# Gigawatt Energy

> Family-run, SAA-accredited solar PV, battery storage and EV charger installer established 2020 in Mickleham VIC, serving homes and businesses across Melbourne's north and west. Registered Electrical Contractor REC-32099, Tesla Powerwall and Sigenergy certified, NETCC Approved Seller, Solar Victoria Authorised Retailer. 1,600+ installations, 5.0 Google rating. Phone +61 451 644 220, info@gigawattenergy.com.au.

